      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　うごかすたびに　きんにくが\nのびちぢみして　でんきが　うまれる。\nピンチになると　からだが　かがやく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 움직일 때마다 근육이 늘어났다\n줄어들었다 하여 전기가 발생한다.\n궁지에 몰리면 몸이 빛난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses muscles génèrent un courant électrique lorsqu’ils\ntravaillent. Il s’illumine en cas de danger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erzeugt Elektrizität durch das Strecken und\nZusammenziehen seiner Muskeln. Bei Bedrohung\nglüht es.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La extensión y contracción de sus músculos genera\nelectricidad. Brilla cuando está en peligro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce elettricità contraendo e rilassando i muscoli.\nQuando si sente minacciato si illumina.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The extension and contraction of its muscles\ngenerates electricity. It glows when in trouble.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体を　動かすたびに　筋肉が\n伸び縮みして　電気が　生まれる。\nピンチになると　体が　輝く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La extensión y contracción de sus músculos genera\nelectricidad. Brilla cuando está en peligro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんを　かんじると　ぜんしんの\nたいもうが　ひかる。あいてが　めを\nくらませている　あいだに　にげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험을 느끼면 전신의 털이\n빛난다. 그로 인해 상대가 앞을\n보지 못하는 동안 도망친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa fourrure étincelle en cas de danger. Il profite du\nfait que l’ennemi est aveuglé pour s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In Gefahr blendet es seinen Gegner mit seinem Fell\nund flieht, während der Gegner einen Moment\nblind ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si siente peligro, todo su pelaje brilla. Aprovecha la\nceguera temporal de su rival para huir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In caso di pericolo, la sua pelliccia si illumina. Il\nnemico rimane accecato e lui ne approfitta per fuggire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees\nwhile the foe is momentarily blinded.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
